    <bpmn:process id="W_W4236" name="W4236. Route Efficiency, Coverage Adherence &amp; Field Productivity" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Productivity review; route/coverage analytics
Frequency: Monthly + quarterly
Volume: Force-wide route/coverage/productivity data
Owner: Sales Operations / Analytics (VS-28)
Participants: Regional Mgrs, Analytics (VS-28), Trade Sales (VS-11), Logistics route (VS-06)
Source: workflow W4236 — Route Efficiency, Coverage Adherence &amp; Field Productivity</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4236_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4236_Lane1" name="Sales Ops">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4236_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4236_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4236_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4236_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4236_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4236_Start3" name="Productivity review; route/coverage analytics">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4236_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4236_Task4" name="Sales Ops/Analytics measure route efficiency (visits/day, travel time/cost…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sales Ops/Analytics measure route efficiency (visits/day, travel time/cost, territory balance) and coverage adherence (actual vs planned call-frequency W4220)
Responsible (R): Sales Ops / Analytics
Accountable (A): Head of Field Sales
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4236_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4236_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4236_Task5" name="Sales Ops/Regional Mgr measure field productivity (selling time vs admin…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sales Ops/Regional Mgr measure field productivity (selling time vs admin, activity-to-outcome) and identify coaching/route/tooling improvements
Responsible (R): Sales Ops / Regional Mgrs
Accountable (A): Head of Field Sales
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4236_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4236_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4236_Task6" name="Sales Ops optimize routes/coverage (re-territory W4219, tooling W4224…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sales Ops optimize routes/coverage (re-territory W4219, tooling W4224, admin-reduction links to VS-133), and report productivity gains (W4233)
Responsible (R): Sales Ops / Analytics
Accountable (A): Head of Trade / Account Management
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
