      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Churn signal; account-health review; retention cycle
Frequency: Monthly + on churn signal
Volume: ~5,400 B2B accounts × account-health score
Owner: Sales Operations / Key Accounts (VS-107) / Trade Sales (VS-11)
Participants: Trade Sales (VS-11), Key Accounts (VS-107), Trade-Pro (VS-43), CDP (VS-126), CX (VS-13)
Source: workflow W4237 — Customer Retention, Churn &amp; Account-Health Management</bpmn:documentation>
