      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4237_Task5" name="Sales Ops/CDP compute account-health (spend trend, recency, share-of-wallet…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sales Ops/CDP compute account-health (spend trend, recency, share-of-wallet, NPS, engagement — links to VS-126) and flag at-risk/churn accounts
Responsible (R): Sales Ops / CDP
Accountable (A): Head of Field Sales
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4237_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4237_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4237_Task6" name="Trade Sales/Key Accounts intervene on at-risk accounts (win-back, relationship…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Trade Sales/Key Accounts intervene on at-risk accounts (win-back, relationship, issue resolution — links to VS-13 CX, VS-43 trade-pro), and document save actions
Responsible (R): Trade Sales / Key Accounts
Accountable (A): Regional Mgr
Duration: On signal</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4237_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4237_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4237_Task7" name="Sales Ops measure retention/churn rate, root-cause churn…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sales Ops measure retention/churn rate, root-cause churn (price/service/competition — links to VS-44), and report to leadership (W4233)
Responsible (R): Sales Ops / Insights
Accountable (A): Head of Trade / Account Management
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4237_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4237_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
