    <bpmn:process id="W_W4240" name="W4240. Field Sales Continuous Improvement &amp; Capability Building" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: OpEx cycle; capability review; market/strategy change
Frequency: Quarterly + on change
Volume: Force-wide continuous improvement
Owner: Head of Field Sales / OpEx (VS-133) / Enablement (VS-124)
Participants: OpEx (VS-133), Enablement (VS-124), Sales Ops, Analytics (VS-28), HR (VS-19)
Source: workflow W4240 — Field Sales Continuous Improvement &amp; Capability Building</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4240_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4240_Lane1" name="Head of Field Sales">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4240_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4240_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4240_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4240_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4240_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4240_Start3" name="OpEx cycle; capability review; market/strategy change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4240_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4240_Task4" name="Head of Field Sales/OpEx identify improvement opportunities (process friction…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Head of Field Sales/OpEx identify improvement opportunities (process friction, admin load, tooling gaps, skill gaps) from analytics (W4235/W4236) and rep feedback
Responsible (R): Head of Field Sales / OpEx / Sales Ops
Accountable (A): Head of Trade / Account Management
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4240_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4240_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4240_Task5" name="Field Sales/Enablement build capabilities (new selling motions, digital/spec…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Field Sales/Enablement build capabilities (new selling motions, digital/spec selling, data-driven selling — links to VS-124/VS-128) and run improvement projects (VS-133/VS-112)
Responsible (R): Head of Field Sales / Enablement / OpEx
Accountable (A): Head of Trade / Account Management
Duration: Per initiative</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4240_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4240_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4240_Task6" name="Field Sales measure improvement impact (productivity, conversion, ROI), sustain…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Field Sales measure improvement impact (productivity, conversion, ROI), sustain changes (standard work, training), and feed learnings into strategy (W4217)
Responsible (R): Head of Field Sales / OpEx
Accountable (A): Head of Trade / Account Management
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4240_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4240_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4240_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4240_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4240_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-652 (ensure controlled execution — Field Sales Performance, Compensation &amp; Route Analytics (PA-140.3).) | - CTL-652: improvements benefit-tracked (VS-133); changes sustained via standard work/training
Owner: Head of Field Sales / OpEx (VS-133) / Enablement (VS-124)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
